  "invariants": [
    "schemaVersion equals 5 and schemaHash equals the approved artifact fixture.",
    "unavailableReason is non-null iff stopDisposition.kind is UNAVAILABLE and equals stopDisposition.reason.",
    "For a recoverySubstate projection, allowedActions equals the singleton translated CastAction or the empty set; consumers may always expose non-operational navigation/menu chrome but no additional Cast intent.",
    "If stopRequested is true and recoverySubstate is null, use stopRequestedWithoutRecoverySubstate.",
    "If stopRequested is true and recoverySubstate is non-null, validate stopRequestedWithRecoverySubstate before using the recovery mapping; invalid combinations fail closed through decodeFailure.",
    "Unknown fields may be ignored only when schemaVersion and schemaHash are already recognized; unknown enum values or mappings fail closed.",
    "automationDisposition, automationReason and automationTargetPackage never widen allowedActions and never override durable Stop, recovery/manual or an active transaction projection."
  ],
